            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "apikey",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create a hosted checkout session. The response includes both short_url and long_url that the merchant can present to the end-user (use short_url to avoid truncation in SMS or WhatsApp)."
